Authentication Requirement

Only familiar connectors signed by petabyte.monster can authenticate to the
platform. Unsigned builds (forks, local builds) will be rejected.

This ensures the connector in your network is the exact code published in
official releases — no backdoors, no modifications.

You can still:
- Read, fork, and modify this code (MIT licensed)
- Use it for any purpose
- Redistribute modified versions

Modified versions just won't connect to petabyte.monster.

Details: https://github.com/leighNZ/petabyte.monster-familiar/blob/main/docs/CODE_SIGNING.md
Releases: https://github.com/leighNZ/petabyte.monster-familiar/releases
